<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Seagate EPS view raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Seagate EPS view raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it raised its earnings estimate for 1997 to $3.50 a share from $3.12 a share.</p>
<p>-- Raised 1998 estimate to $4.92 a share from $3.99 a share.</p>
<p>-- Cited expectations for continued strong demand, improved gross margins, slightly higher expenses and modestly reduced share count.</p>
<p>-- Tuesday, Seagate posted third quarter profits of $1.01 a share compared to a loss of $0.78 a share last year.</p>
<p>-- Shares lost 3/4 to 50-3/4.</p>
</text>
